      "content": "i know people say there's always a way but it's just not true for me. i've tried everything and i'm just a failure. the shame of it all... i feel like a burden to everyone. even if i find a way to pay it, the damage is done. i just want the noise to stop. everything feels so heavy and there's just no light at the end of this. it feels like i've reached the end of the road.",
